    {
      "id": "king-lear/sceneIV_18.3/p@151668",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "KENT.\nWhy the King of France is so suddenly gone back, know you no reason?",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "king-lear/sceneIV_18.3/p@151668/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 5,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "king-lear/sceneIV_18.3/p@151668/line-2",
          "start": 6,
          "end": 74,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 3325123,
        "end": 3325226,
        "line": 121393,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap18/p@151668",
        "anchor": "sceneIV_18.3"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "KENT.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 5
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "king-lear/sceneIV_18.3/p@151775",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "GENTLEMAN.\nSomething he left imperfect in the state, which since his coming forth is thought of, which imports to the kingdom so much fear and danger that his personal return was most required and necessary.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "king-lear/sceneIV_18.3/p@151775/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 10,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "king-lear/sceneIV_18.3/p@151775/line-2",
          "start": 11,
          "end": 207,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 3325230,
        "end": 3325468,
        "line": 121398,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap18/p@151775",
        "anchor": "sceneIV_18.3"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "GENTLEMAN.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 10
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "king-lear/sceneIV_18.3/p@152017",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "KENT.\nWho hath he left behind him general?",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "king-lear/sceneIV_18.3/p@152017/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 5,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "king-lear/sceneIV_18.3/p@152017/line-2",
          "start": 6,
          "end": 42,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 3325472,
        "end": 3325544,
        "line": 121405,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap18/p@152017",
        "anchor": "sceneIV_18.3"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "KENT.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 5
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "king-lear/sceneIV_18.3/p@152093",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "GENTLEMAN.\nThe Mareschal of France, Monsieur La Far.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "king-lear/sceneIV_18.3/p@152093/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 10,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "king-lear/sceneIV_18.3/p@152093/line-2",
          "start": 11,
          "end": 52,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 3325548,
        "end": 3325630,
        "line": 121410,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap18/p@152093",
        "anchor": "sceneIV_18.3"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "GENTLEMAN.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 10
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "king-lear/sceneIV_18.3/p@152179",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "KENT.\nDid your letters pierce the queen to any demonstration of grief?",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "king-lear/sceneIV_18.3/p@152179/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 5,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "king-lear/sceneIV_18.3/p@152179/line-2",
          "start": 6,
          "end": 70,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 3325634,
        "end": 3325734,
        "line": 121415,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap18/p@152179",
        "anchor": "sceneIV_18.3"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "KENT.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 5
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "king-lear/sceneIV_18.3/p@152283",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "GENTLEMAN.\nAy, sir; she took them, read them in my presence;\nAnd now and then an ample tear trill’d down\nHer delicate cheek. It seem’d she was a queen\nOver her passion; who, most rebel-like,\nSought to be king o’er her.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "king-lear/sceneIV_18.3/p@152283/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 10,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "king-lear/sceneIV_18.3/p@152283/line-2",
          "start": 11,
          "end": 60,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "king-lear/sceneIV_18.3/p@152283/line-3",
          "start": 61,
          "end": 104,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "king-lear/sceneIV_18.3/p@152283/line-4",
          "start": 105,
          "end": 150,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "king-lear/sceneIV_18.3/p@152283/line-5",
          "start": 151,
          "end": 190,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "king-lear/sceneIV_18.3/p@152283/line-6",
          "start": 191,
          "end": 218,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 3325738,
        "end": 3326006,
        "line": 121420,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap18/p@152283",
        "anchor": "sceneIV_18.3"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "GENTLEMAN.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 10
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "king-lear/sceneIV_18.3/p@152555",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "KENT.\nO, then it mov’d her.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "king-lear/sceneIV_18.3/p@152555/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 5,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "king-lear/sceneIV_18.3/p@152555/line-2",
          "start": 6,
          "end": 27,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 3326010,
        "end": 3326067,
        "line": 121429,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap18/p@152555",
        "anchor": "sceneIV_18.3"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "KENT.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 5
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "king-lear/sceneIV_18.3/p@152616",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "GENTLEMAN.\nNot to a rage: patience and sorrow strove\nWho should express her goodliest. You have seen\nSunshine and rain at once: her smiles and tears\nWere like a better day. Those happy smilets\nThat play’d on her ripe lip seem’d not to know\nWhat guests were in her eyes; which parted thence\nAs pearls from diamonds dropp’d. In brief,\nSorrow would be a rarity most belov’d,\nIf all could so become it.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "king-lear/sceneIV_18.3/p@152616/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 10,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "king-lear/sceneIV_18.3/p@152616/line-2",
          "start": 11,
          "end": 52,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "king-lear/sceneIV_18.3/p@152616/line-3",
          "start": 53,
          "end": 100,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "king-lear/sceneIV_18.3/p@152616/line-4",
          "start": 101,
          "end": 148,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "king-lear/sceneIV_18.3/p@152616/line-5",
          "start": 149,
          "end": 192,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "king-lear/sceneIV_18.3/p@152616/line-6",
          "start": 193,
          "end": 239,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "king-lear/sceneIV_18.3/p@152616/line-7",
          "start": 240,
          "end": 289,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "king-lear/sceneIV_18.3/p@152616/line-8",
          "start": 290,
          "end": 332,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "king-lear/sceneIV_18.3/p@152616/line-9",
          "start": 333,
          "end": 371,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
