        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "KENT.\nWell, sir, the poor distressed Lear’s i’ the town;\nWho sometime, in his better tune, remembers\nWhat we are come about, and by no means\nWill yield to see his daughter.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
